{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome back to the world where you will only find liminality and loneliness... now with better graphics. But remember, don't get lost in this dream.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overall Game Info:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Solitude Project is a complete rework and a Spin-Off of A Liminal Place Legacy (also known as Remastered), now featuring HWRT (Hardware Ray Tracing) and Fully Simulated RT Lights (Psycho mode), better physics (at least a bit better), a new puzzle, improved optimization, and more! (Still no save function.) Find your way to the next level, do whatever you want! But remember... you will never find the exit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But at least you\u2019ll have some relaxing and nostalgic environments. The game is very short, but I\u2019ll try to expand it with more DLCs or storylines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game made by a teenager.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Gameplay Features (Including missing features):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hardware Ray-Traced Reflections and GI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fully Simulated Lightning (Ray Tracing / Path Tracing, optional)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Better environments and better textures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Better optimization.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Music radios in some levels :D.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Some floaties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Water physics (Missing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Footstep system (Missing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- NO SAVES. (Not a feature, but let\u2019s give it a go again.) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cThe choice is yours, wanderer.\u201d</i></strong></p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"The Eternal Sun Rise","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3452280/874eb0b5d8f2e3c9db2967b0be1ff19c60b003ad.jpg"}],"total":1},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452280?t=1773511332","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3452280?t=1773511332","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452280/e3c94ca32b1c14dc2beff9789657b64cbf673195/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773511332","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452280/e3c94ca32b1c14dc2beff9789657b64cbf673195/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773511332","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome back to the world where you will only find liminality and loneliness... now with better graphics. But remember, don't get lost in this dream.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Overall Game Info:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Solitude Project is a complete rework and a Spin-Off of A Liminal Place Legacy (also known as Remastered), now featuring HWRT (Hardware Ray Tracing) and Fully Simulated RT Lights (Psycho mode), better physics (at least a bit better), a new puzzle, improved optimization, and more! (Still no save function.) Find your way to the next level, do whatever you want! But remember... you will never find the exit.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>But at least you\u2019ll have some relaxing and nostalgic environments. The game is very short, but I\u2019ll try to expand it with more DLCs or storylines.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game made by a teenager.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Main Gameplay Features (Including missing features):</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Hardware Ray-Traced Reflections and GI.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Fully Simulated Lightning (Ray Tracing / Path Tracing, optional)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Better environments and better textures.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Better optimization.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Music radios in some levels :D.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Some floaties.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Water physics (Missing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Footstep system (Missing).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- NO SAVES. (Not a feature, but let\u2019s give it a go again.) </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong><i>\u201cThe choice is yours, wanderer.\u201d</i></strong></p>","developers":["Mirage Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3452280/header.jpg?t=1773511332","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3452280/834832/fe2d5b90bc8b0832517ada1b859254446c965d73/1750852512/dash_av1.mpd?t=1740501435","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3452280/834832/fe2d5b90bc8b0832517ada1b859254446c965d73/1750852512/dash_h264.mpd?t=1740501435","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3452280/834832/fe2d5b90bc8b0832517ada1b859254446c965d73/1750852512/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1740501435","id":257102086,"name":"TRAILER","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257102086/171a6d4cd42c2f58e2421f2bb5ca79aca5724c7d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1